# E2E Test Infra: openOODA Installation & Governance Adversarial Audit

## Test Philosophy
- Zero-trust, opaque-box, first-principles verification.
- Elimination of all synthetic constants, untested fallbacks, silent failures, and non-fail-closed paths.
- Methodology: 4-Tier Opaque-Box Coverage + 5th Tier Adversarial Red Team Veto Gates.

## Feature Inventory & Test Mapping
| # | Feature | Requirement | Tier 1 (Feature) | Tier 2 (Boundary) | Tier 3 (Cross) | Tier 4 (Scenario) | Tier 5 (Red Team) |
|---|---------|-------------|:----------------:|:-----------------:|:--------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|
| 1 | Minisign Ed25519 & SHA-256 Dual Verification | R1 | Match digests & sigs | Forged sig, corrupted digest | Dual verify + sidecars | Fresh system install | `install_redteam_breaktest` Gate 1 & 2 |
| 2 | Fail-Closed Network & Packaging Ingestion | R1 | Abort on 404/fail | Truncated tarball | Missing minisign tool | Mirror outage | `install_redteam_breaktest` Gate 3 & 4 |
| 3 | Silicon Telemetry Hardware Probes | R2 | CPU & SIMD detect | Non-AVX / ARM NEON / no-LSM | SIMD width + threads | Real machine telemetry | `simd_codegen_probe.oo` |
| 4 | Boyd Specific Excess Power ($P_s$) | R2 | Real $P_s$ calc | Low/high core counts | Drag reduction (95.5%) | EM calculation | Empirical parameter audit |
| 5 | 18-Tool Cognitive Discovery Matrix | R3 | 18 tools detected | Missing tools / Standby | MCP merge + config write | Multi-tool ecosystem | Alphabetical order + legend audit |
| 6 | Safe MCP Merge & Neovim Config | R3 | Valid JSON/Lua written | Bare filenames, nil paths | Non-clobbering existing | Neovim IDE integration | Parser/syntax checks |
| 7 | Shell Profile Modifications & Palette | R4 | Idempotent appends | Multi-invocation runs | PATH resolution | Interactive TTY palette | 78-col formatting check |
| 8 | 10 Governance Pillars Compliance | R5 | `__FAILS__=0` | Edge-case code styles | All source files | Whole-repo enforcement | `enforcer.oo` |
| 9 | 13 Process Boards Verification | R5 | 13 boards valid | Empty/malformed boards | Sludge file check | Multi-tier boards | `check_board.oo` & `verify_all.oo` |
| 10| 8 Red Team Adversarial Gates | R5 | Zero vetoes | Mutant injection / O(N) | Timing attack resistance | Master release gates | `redteam_hook.oo` (9 gates) |

## Test Execution Commands
- Governance Pillars: `ooda/bin/ooda scripts/enforcer.oo`
- Process Boards: `ooda/bin/ooda scripts/verify_all.oo`
- Red Team Adversarial Gates: `ooda/bin/ooda scripts/redteam_hook.oo`
- Installer Break-Tests: `ooda/bin/ooda scripts/install_redteam_breaktest.oo`
- Shell syntax validation: `bash -n openOODA.github.io/install.sh openOODA.github.io/install/install.sh`
- Column width validation: `awk 'length > 78 { print NR, length, $0 }'` on installer scripts and palettes.
